meta {
  name: Get Team Audit Log
  type: http
  seq: 1
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/teams/{{teamId}}/audit
  body: none
  auth: none
}

headers {
  Cookie: {{sessionCookie}}
}

params:query {
  ~page: 1
  ~limit: 20
  ~event: virtual_key_revoked
  ~actorId: {{actorId}}
}

docs {
  The whole team's trail, newest first. Owner and admin only, and only with a
  signed-in session — a Bearer API key returns 401 UNAUTHORIZED here, unlike the
  per-prompt and per-tool trails.

  Grab {{sessionCookie}} from a signed-in browser (the better-auth session cookie,
  name and value together) or from the Set-Cookie of a sign-in call.

  `event` takes a comma-separated list of AuditEvent names; an unknown name is a
  400 rather than being ignored. `actorId` is one user UUID, including someone who
  has since been removed from the team. Both narrow `total`, not just the page.
}
